{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜(ながしまりお）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も読みに来てくれてありがとう( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近はゴールデンウィークも終わって\n学校やお仕事が始まった頃ですかね､､、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "休み明け、何かとしんどい！と思う事も沢山あると思いますが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな時は私たちを見て元気出してください💪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつでもエナジー供給の準備万端です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はオンラインミート＆グリートがありますね¨̮⃝"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobLjrCsK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この前のリアミのお洋服🎀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう半袖の時期だねぇ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も皆さんと沢山お話できたら嬉しいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゴールデンウィークのお話とか、\n沢山聞かせてください😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういえば、こどもの日もありましたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobkGxI8N.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂工事中でも登場した1枚！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おそらく米粒を盗み食いしてる腹ぺこりおです👶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもどんどん成長するぞー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではでは、\nまた書くね¨̮⃝"}], "source": "official"}